== Trivia ==
* Door Stop is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=894758868 this Steam Workshop trinket] by Strawrat and CupertinoEffect - which in turn is based on [https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=892838724 this Steam Workshop trinket] by Lord Pigfoot Nosebeggar XVII.
* Before ''[[Repentance+]]'', the pickup quote included an exclamation point.
* The pickup quote may be a reference to the ''Game of Thrones'' episode [[wikipedia:The Door (Game of Thrones)|The Door]] where the same quote is repeatedly exclaimed.

